=== S17 — A preceding STATIONARY segment supplies the boarding station, and its own lookup replaces the slowBefore one — the apparent velocity from the stay to slowBefore is tunnel-noise fast.
S17.trace: [{"kind":"stations","lat":51.5,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"stations","lat":51.54,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"lines","lat":51.5,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"lines","lat":51.54,"lon":-0.1}]
