=== S51 — The sweep must SKIP a candidate carrying the boarding station's own name. Boarding at Beeston, the alight site's SECOND candidate is a through-station also tagged 'Beeston', and its retry would match — so without the skip the run is labelled with the degenerate pair 'Beeston → Beeston'. The candidate it settles on shares TWO lines, and every mid-ride fix is on the stretch Alpha and Beta share, so nothing separates them and the bare pair stands: a two-element retry must not simply take its first entry.
