=== S54 — The pause window is INCLUSIVE at its start: a fix sitting exactly on `startTs` belongs to the pause. Here it is the one far fix, and admitting it drags the centroid out and rejects the pause; excluding it would leave two fixes 6 m apart and absorb.
S54.trace: [{"kind":"stations","lat":51.5,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"stations","lat":51.54,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"stations","lat":51.5,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"stations","lat":51.54,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"lines","lat":51.5,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"lines","lat":51.54,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"lines","lat":51.5,"lon":-0.1},{"kind":"lines","lat":51.54,"lon":-0.1}]
