per-mode, not global = cycling|Canal Path|cycleway|4  walking|-|footway|2  walking|-|-|-
empty name is unnamed = driving|Barn Rise|residential|9  walking|Barn Rise|residential|9  cycling|Barn Rise|residential|9  walking|-|-|-

=== cadence veto ===
cadence vetoes driving+cycling = walking|Barn Rise|residential|8  walking|-|-|-
fast: veto premise fails = driving|Barn Rise|residential|8  walking|Barn Rise|residential|8  cycling|Barn Rise|residential|8  walking|-|-|-
no cadence = driving|Barn Rise|residential|8  walking|Barn Rise|residential|8  cycling|Barn Rise|residential|8  walking|-|-|-
fallback survives its own veto = walking|Barn Rise|residential|8  driving|-|-|-
veto changes what dedup sees = walking|Barn Rise|residential|8  walking|-|-|-

