### walk-annotate-refs.mts

=== the pass ===
--- plain walking leg
    read ways 51.501000,-0.140000 r=231
    read buildings 51.501000,-0.140000 r=231
    seg[1000,1240] raw (no path)
--- refinedMode walking over a raw non-walk mode
    read ways 51.501000,-0.140000 r=231
    read buildings 51.501000,-0.140000 r=231
    seg[1000,1240] raw (no path)
--- non-walking leg is untouched and reads nothing
    seg[1000,1240] raw (no path)
--- three fixes — below MIN_LEG_FIXES, reads nothing
    seg[1000,1120] raw (no path)
--- a fix over the walking speed cap is excluded from the window
    read ways 51.501000,-0.140000 r=231
    read buildings 51.501000,-0.140000 r=231
    seg[1000,1240] raw (no path)
--- empty ways — no buildings read, leg untouched
    read ways 51.501000,-0.140000 r=231
    seg[1000,1240] raw (no path)
--- WALK_MATCH_DISABLE=1 — whole pass is a no-op
    seg[1000,1240] raw (no path)
--- corner-cutting raw line — the gate has something to fix
    read ways 51.501400,-0.138660 r=301
    read buildings 51.501400,-0.138660 r=301
    seg[1000,1240] matched n=3 len=430.0421 first=51.500000,-0.140000@1000 last=51.502000,-0.137000@1240
--- corner + buildings — corrector arm eligible
    read ways 51.501400,-0.138660 r=301
    read buildings 51.501400,-0.138660 r=301
    seg[1000,1240] matched n=3 len=430.0421 first=51.500000,-0.140000@1000 last=51.502000,-0.137000@1240
